  "title": "usb: register interface protocol if device protocol was null",
  "description": "Some USB devices expose descriptors that delegate protocol description to their interfaces...\n![imagen](/uploads/28835ac6df45f3cb445345a987344c27/imagen.png)\n\nSee https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/packet-usb.c?ref_type=heads#L665\n\nThis patch attempts to register a protocol candidate during interface enumeration if device description was not successful.",
