    {
      "id": "996d2a528fb0fa344d106798d28042eb59acb623",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1710182197,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hi Thomas,\n\nSorry, it is now obvious to me that the problem this MR us trying to fix is not fully explained. Please, find attached down below an example of a capture that exhibits the behaviour I am trying to solve. Particularly, this Nordic nrf52840 Bluetooth USB dongle is describing its device as the all zero class/subclass/protocol triple.\n\n[0012_-_usb_hci_win_test_2.pcapng](/uploads/83bd83620a225d8352e0e420b418cdc3/0012_-_usb_hci_win_test_2.pcapng)\n\nMy suggestion with this patch was to do a check while parsing the device configuration. If this particular case takes place, try to obtain information about the protocol in this stage...\n\nHere is a comparison before and after the patch:\n![imagen](/uploads/7d8b37e9a42332995d9d1f064ebbe1b1/imagen.png)\n![imagen](/uploads/b0b65b898bfd3b4b8117ab55ae03254c/imagen.png)\n\nThe patch works for the attached example and others with a little bit more complexity that I have captured using similar devices but that I cannot share.\n\nUnfortunately, I am not that well versed in USB protocol and have not yet come across an IAD example. I can try to add IAD to my proposal but it will be best to have an example to verify the results.\n\nMoreover, from your comment, I am not sure if what I have proposed somewhat aligns with a valid solution or if you would prefer to give me some pointers on a better implementation for my usecase.\n\nThank you.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2445059,
            "username": "antoniovazquezblanco",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Antonio Vázquez Blanco",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3003c2b03cbc9f8b4f0fb99281e9d1ede120aac36545e6664cec362f0af5c3af?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/antoniovazquezblanco"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-12-30T11:15:09.846Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-12-30T19:45:19.091Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 272655862,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
